    "Title": "Pro Tem Group Warrant (Reevaluation)",
    "Description": "Hey,\n\nI've been thinking over everything that went down and decided to speak to management. They've agreed to give you another chance but only if you successfully complete a contract for us.\n\nWe can look at reinstating your employment status if you can bring in this criminal trio:\n~mission(Target1)\n~mission(Target2)\n~mission(Target3)\n\nThey evaded the last Associate who went after them, so you bringing them all in would definitely earn you some points.\n\nHopefully you've gotten your act together since your last job.\n\nBraden Corchado\nLogistics Officer - Stanton Branch\nNorthrock Service Group",
    "DisplayDescription": "Hey,\n\nI've been thinking over everything that went down and decided to speak to management. They've agreed to give you another chance but only if you successfully complete a contract for us.\n\nWe can look at reinstating your employment status if you can bring in this criminal trio:\n[Target1]\n[Target2]\n[Target3]\n\nThey evaded the last Associate who went after them, so you bringing them all in would definitely earn you some points.\n\nHopefully you've gotten your act together since your last job.\n\nBraden Corchado\nLogistics Officer - Stanton Branch\nNorthrock Service Group",
